#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0095 expect=noViolation domain=SUPPSV
#note "SUPP-- referencing SV is exempt in SDTM-IG versions prior to 3.4 (the sheet's SV exception) -> no violation. The 3.4 sibling PMDA-SD0095-A drops the exemption."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-3
#library dataset-class SV "SPECIAL PURPOSE"
dataset SUPPSV class=RELATIONSHIP label="Supplemental Qualifiers for SV"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col RDOMAIN type=Char label="Related Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col QNAM    type=Char label="Qualifier Variable Name"
col QVAL    type=Char label="Data Value"
---
S1 | SV | 001 | VISITREA | Unscheduled visit reason
